# ---------- 2. atoms and cell ----------
# box/relax relaxes the cell to the target pressure (bar): iso = same
# scaling on x, y, z; aniso = x, y, z independent; tri also the angles.
# For a slab with vacuum use "x 0.0 y 0.0" (never z, the vacuum would collapse).
fix             relax all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize        0.0 1.0e-3 10000 100000
